{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10106","headline":"夜闻江南人家赛神因题即事 · 李嘉佑","name":"夜闻江南人家赛神因题即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南方淫祀古风俗，楚妪解唱迎神曲。\n枪枪铜鼓芦叶深，寂寂琼筵江水绿。\n雨过风清洲渚闲，椒浆醉尽迎神还。\n帝女凌空下湘岸，番君隔浦向尧山。\n月隐回塘犹自舞，一门依倚神之祜。\n韩康灵药不复求，扁鹊医方曾莫覩。\n逐客临江空自悲，月明流水无已时。\n听此迎神送神曲，携觞欲吊屈原祠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}